<title>SPAIN: Spain stability plan - PSBR for year 1997-2000.</title>
<headline>Spain stability plan - PSBR for year 1997-2000.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is Spain's projections for the deficit under a new stability pact for the public administration from 1997 to 2000 on a national account basis and as a percentage of GDP:</p>
<p>						  1997    1998   1999   2000</p>
<p>Public Sector Borrowing</p>
<p>Requirement (-)</p>
<p>    or Surplus  (+)			 -3.0     -2.5   -2.0  -1.6</p>
<p>    Central Administration		-2.7     -2.3   -1.8  -1.4</p>
<p>    State				     -2.5     -2.1   -1.7  -1.3</p>
<p>    Social Security			 -0.2     -0.2   -0.1  -0.1</p>
<p>    Regional governments		  -0.3     -0.2   -0.2  -0.2</p>
<p>    Gross Debt				68.2     67.7   66.7  65.3</p>
<p>    Primary surplus			  1.9	2.1    2.3   2.6</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
